IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uro-nouns`

-- Social Security Benefits Up-rating Order 2026 (S.I. 2026/148): PART 5, ARTICLE 29 (STATE PENSION CREDIT).
-- Layer 1. Article 29 amends the State Pension Credit Regulations 2002, which are not among the inputs. Every figure the
-- Order states is a value; what each sum is a sum OF (the standard minimum guarantee, a threshold) is for those
-- Regulations, so the encoding names a sum by its place in them and no more.
-- Dates: art 29 comes into force on the first day of the beneficiary's first benefit week to commence on or after
-- 6th April 2026 (art 1(3)(k)): uro-part1-intro.
-- Article 29(1) ("any reference in this article to a numbered regulation or Schedule is a reference to ...") is a
-- cross-reference convention and is not encoded.

§ `Article 29 -- State Pension Credit`

