@ref art 29(2)(a) (src:356-357)
`art 29(2)(a): regulation 6(1)(a) of the State Pension Credit Regulations, the amount of the guarantee credit` MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF 346.60, 363.25

-- src:358 | (b) in paragraph (1)(b) for “£227.10” substitute “£238.00”;
@ref art 29(2)(b) (src:358)
