@ref art 29(3) (src:362)
`art 29(3): regulation 7(2) of the State Pension Credit Regulations, the second sum for savings credit` MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF 314.34, 329.75

@ref art 29(3) (src:362)
DECLARE `a sum in regulation 7(2) of the State Pension Credit Regulations` IS ONE OF
    `State Pension Credit regulation 7(2) first sum`
    `State Pension Credit regulation 7(2) second sum`

@ref art 29(3) (src:362)
GIVEN `which one` IS A `a sum in regulation 7(2) of the State Pension Credit Regulations`
GIVETH A `a sum and its replacement`
`art 29(3): the replaced and the replacing sum` `which one` MEANS
    CONSIDER `which one`
