GIVEN `which one` IS A `a sub-paragraph of a non-dependant deduction provision`
GIVETH A `a sum and its replacement`
`art 29(4): the replaced and the replacing sum in the non-dependant deductions` `which one` MEANS
    CONSIDER `which one`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (1)(a)` THEN `art 29(4)(a): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (1)(a)`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (1)(b)` THEN `art 29(4)(b): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (1)(b)`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (2)(a)` THEN `art 29(4)(c): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (2)(a)`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (2)(b)(i)` THEN `art 29(4)(d)(i): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (2)(b)(i)`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (2)(b)(ii)` THEN `art 29(4)(d)(ii): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (2)(b)(ii)`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (2)(b)(iii)` THEN `art 29(4)(d)(iii): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (2)(b)(iii)`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (2)(c)(i)` THEN `art 29(4)(e)(i): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (2)(c)(i)`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (2)(c)(ii)` THEN `art 29(4)(e)(ii): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (2)(c)(ii)`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (2)(c)(iii)` THEN `art 29(4)(e)(iii): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (2)(c)(iii)`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (2)(d)(i)` THEN `art 29(4)(f)(i): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (2)(d)(i)`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (2)(d)(ii)` THEN `art 29(4)(f)(ii): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (2)(d)(ii)`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (2)(d)(iii)` THEN `art 29(4)(f)(iii): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (2)(d)(iii)`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (2)(e)(i)` THEN `art 29(4)(g)(i): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (2)(e)(i)`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (2)(e)(ii)` THEN `art 29(4)(g)(ii): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (2)(e)(ii)`
    WHEN `sub-paragraph (2)(e)(iii)` THEN `art 29(4)(g)(iii): paragraph 14 of Schedule II to the State Pension Credit Regulations, sub-paragraph (2)(e)(iii)`


