GIVETH A `a sum and its replacement`
`art 29(5) and (6): the replaced and the replacing sum` `which one` MEANS
    CONSIDER `which one`
    WHEN `State Pension Credit Schedule IIA paragraph 9(1)(a)` THEN `art 29(5)(a): paragraph 9(1)(a) of Schedule IIA to the State Pension Credit Regulations, the additional amount`
